                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.8"&gt;11.3.8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Clarify the &lt;code&gt;CenterX&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;CenterY&lt;/code&gt; properties documentation in &lt;code&gt;RotateTransform&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/YoriMirus/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/YoriMirus"&gt;@YoriMirus&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3470101564" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19741" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19741/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19741"&gt;#19741&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add internal &lt;code&gt;PointerCaptureChanging&lt;/code&gt; event by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/miloush/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/miloush"&gt;@miloush&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3515962726" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19833" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19833/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19833"&gt;#19833&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Distribute &lt;code&gt;LineGap&lt;/code&gt; evenly to top and bottom by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3359004187" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19556" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19556/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19556"&gt;#19556&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Adjust &lt;code&gt;GetBackspaceCaretCharacterHit&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3378761448" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19586" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19586/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19586"&gt;#19586&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Enable network location browsing in GTK file chooser dialogs by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/meywd/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/meywd"&gt;@meywd&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3523922469" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19855" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19855/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19855"&gt;#19855&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;PlatformDataTransferItem.TryGetRaw&lt;/code&gt; for unknown formats by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3496580091" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19791" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19791/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19791"&gt;#19791&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Ignore &lt;code&gt;PointerOver&lt;/code&gt; change when pointer event is &lt;code&gt;CancelCapture&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3503489659" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19808" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19808/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19808"&gt;#19808&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Added guards in &lt;code&gt;TryGetGlyphTypeface&lt;/code&gt; so the &lt;code&gt;$Default&lt;/code&gt; placeholder stops. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wieslawsoltes/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wieslawsoltes"&gt;@wieslawsoltes&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3540544603" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19891" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19891/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19891"&gt;#19891&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – &lt;code&gt;LayoutTransformControl&lt;/code&gt;: fix memory leak due to &lt;code&gt;Transform.Changed&lt;/code&gt; event subscription by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/pavelovcharov/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/pavelovcharov"&gt;@pavelovcharov&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3458151360" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19718" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19718/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19718"&gt;#19718&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Make &lt;code&gt;ScreenBase&lt;/code&gt; impl more reliable by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3483072898" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19762" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19762/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19762"&gt;#19762&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix &lt;code&gt;ArgumentException&lt;/code&gt; when showing multiple notifications with the same content by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/fgsfds/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/fgsfds"&gt;@fgsfds&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3488586429" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19774" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19774/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19774"&gt;#19774&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Themes – Fix &lt;code&gt;Checkbox&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;RadioButton&lt;/code&gt; height in compact density of Fluent theme. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/miishan/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/miishan"&gt;@miishan&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3532515257" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19882" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19882/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19882"&gt;#19882&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XAML – Fix &lt;code&gt;ExpressionParseException&lt;/code&gt; being reported as an internal compiler error by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3507341874" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19817" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19817/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19817"&gt;#19817&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Fix DBus tray icon &lt;code&gt;NullReferenceException&lt;/code&gt; when change visible by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/memorydream/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/memorydream"&gt;@memorydream&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3470848423" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19742" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19742/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19742"&gt;#19742&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Fix margins and nc hit test for caption buttons in extend to client windows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3487253163" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19773" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19773/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19773"&gt;#19773&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Fix &lt;code&gt;Win32Exception&lt;/code&gt; when a file picker has an invalid file type by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3505516655" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19812" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19812/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19812"&gt;#19812&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Add finalizer to &lt;code&gt;Win32Icon&lt;/code&gt; which frees its GDI handle by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3505621072" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19813" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19813/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19813"&gt;#19813&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Prevent duplicated files during drag-and-drop by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3526378561" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19864" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19864/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19864"&gt;#19864&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Properly handle non standard italic/oblique fonts on Windows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3531803761" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19876" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19876/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19876"&gt;#19876&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Fix scaling of inset when app is launched by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3498759711" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19797" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19797/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19797"&gt;#19797&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Add &lt;code&gt;parent&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;automationPeer&lt;/code&gt; null guards on &lt;code&gt;AvnWindow&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jmacato/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jmacato"&gt;@jmacato&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3502347680" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19805" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19805/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19805"&gt;#19805&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/11.3.7...11.3.8"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;11.3.7...11.3.8&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
